\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.1}{\ignorespaces Cumulative recovery curve over a thirty-day cycle for an equivalent cohort of Bucket~0 cases, under the agency-only baseline (blue) and the platform (red). The platform recovers 70~percent of allocations within the first five days and reaches an 85~percent cycle-end rate against the baseline's 38~percent and 64~percent respectively; the gap is largest in the first five days, which is where the multi-channel orchestration and after-hours AI calling contribute most.}}{23}{figure.caption.11}%
